gon running back Dierre Hill Jr. limped off the field with an injury in the first quarter against Michigan State on Friday night.","published":"2026-11-21T05:36:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50545816/oregon-running-back-dierre-hill-exits-vs-michigan-state-injury","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Revised Protect College Sports Act allows conferences to expand up to 22 schools","description":"Federal lawmakers published a revised version of the Protect College Sports Act on Friday as the U.S. House of Representatives prepares to push for a vote during the first week of December. President Donald Trump also voiced his support for the bill.","published":"2026-11-21T02:51:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-sports/story/_/id/50545220/protect-college-sports-act-revised-donald-trump-voices-support","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Dan Murphy","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"College football games this weekend: Top 25 schedule","description":"Here's what to know about the college football slate for the Top 25 this weekend.","published":"2026-11-20T21:19:52.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542897/college-football-games-top-25-schedule-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Miami WR Malachi Toney 'really close' to return after ankle surgery, coach says","description":"Miami star wide receiver Malachi Toney is about a week and a half from returning from surgery for a high ankle sprain, coach Mario Cristobal told \"The Pat McAfee Show.\"","published":"2026-11-21T16:08:35.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50542494/malachi-toney-nearing-return-ankle-surgery-coach-says","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4905925/devan-thompkins","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins"},"pick":{"pick":31,"round":1,"team":"SF","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Devan Thompkins","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Devan_Thompkins","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-18T13:13:47Z","intro":"Devan Thompkins is an American college football defensive tackle for the Alabama Crimson Tide. He previously played for the USC Trojans.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Thompkins attended St. Mary's High School in Stockton, California for three years before transferring to Edison High School in Stockton for his senior year. He played basketball at St. Mary's and did not play football until his senior year at Edison. He played defensive end and tight end in high school and had nine tackles and caught three passes for 24 yards. Thompkins committed to the University of Southern California (USC) to play college football."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"Thompkins played in three combined games his first two years at USC in 2022 and 2023. In 2024, he started six of 13 games and recorded 24 tackles and 1.5 sacks. In 2025, he had 31 tackles and three sacks. After the season, Thompkins entered the transfer portal."}]}}